<title>UKRAINE: TENNIS-UKRAINE BEAT NORWAY IN DAVIS CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-UKRAINE BEAT NORWAY IN DAVIS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-09-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine beat Norway 4-1 in their Davis Cup tennis Euro/African zone group one play-off after sharing the final singles on Sunday.</p>
<p>Results (Ukraine names first): </p>
<p>Andrei Medvedev beat Christian Ruud 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>Denis Yakimenko lost to Jan Frode Andersen (Norway) 6-7 (2-7) 4-6</p>
